9. Testing
Table creation: `SHOW TABLES;` should list five tables.
Sample records: select from each table and verify inserted rows.
JOIN test: combine Orders, Buyers, Crops, and Farmers to show complete order information.
View test: `SELECT \* FROM OrderDetails;` should return the three sample orders.
Procedure test: `CALL ShowAvailableCrops();` should list crops whose stock is greater than zero.
Valid stock test: insert an order for 10 kg of onion when 60 kg is available; onion stock should become 50 kg.
Invalid stock test: attempt to order more than available stock; the trigger should reject the insert.
Payment report: verify order 2 has ₹300 remaining.
